{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2022-07-21 08:00:00', 'title': 'NORFOLK SOUTHERN INCREASES CONDUCTOR TRAINEE PAY TO $25 AN HOUR; ADDS BIWEEKLY $300 INCENTIVE', 'text': 'TRAINEES ELIGIBLE FOR STARTING BONUSES OF UP TO $5,000 IN PRIORITY LOCATIONS ATLANTA , JULY 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION (NYSE: NSC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS INCREASED CONDUCTOR TRAINEE PAY TO $25 PER HOUR, WITH A MINIMUM OF $200 IN EARNINGS PER SHIFT.\xa0ADDITIONALLY, CONDUCTOR TRAINEES ARE ELIGIBLE FOR AN ON THE JOB TRAINING INCENTIVE OF $300 PER BI-WEEKLY PAY PERIOD, PROVIDED THEY MAKE THEMSELVES AVAILABLE TO WORK.'}